::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 8px;\n    top: 50%;\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\n    width: 12px;\n    height: 12px;\n    background: #d9e6f2;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n  .activity-label .dots {\n    flex: 1;\n    border-bottom: 1.5px dotted #9db8cd;\n    margin-left: 6px;\n    height: 1px;\n  }\n  .photo-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 8px 14px;\n    margin: 0 6px 14px 12px;\n  }\n  .photo-cell { text-align: center; }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 118px;\n    background: #e8edf1;\n    border: 1px solid #c9d4dd;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-family: \"Heiti SC\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #667;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    padding: 4px;\n  }\n  .caption {\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .q-list { margin: 12px 0 0 6px; }\n  .q-item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .q-item .marker {\n    color: #2f6d9e;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-right: 5px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n  }\n  .answer {\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", serif;\n    color: #1f4e79;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .answer-line {\n    text-align: right;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", serif;\n    color: #1f4e79;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    border-bottom: 1px dotted #2f6d9e;\n    margin: 0 6px 4px 60px;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    margin-top: 26px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-family: \"Heiti SC\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .footer .pagenum {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n  }\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 30px;\n    bottom: 40px;\n    font-family: \"Heiti SC\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 42px;\n    color: rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n    transform: rotate(-18deg);\n    pointer-events: none;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <h1 class=\"lesson-no\">第三课</h1>\n  <h1 class=\"lesson-title\">社会生活离不开规则</h1>\n\n  <p class=\"intro\">井然有序的社会生活离不开社会规则的维系。规则划定自由的边界，保障人们的自由。我们应该自觉遵守规则，坚定维护规则，积极改进规则，与规则同行，创建美好生活。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"bar\"></span>维护秩序<span class=\"bar\"></span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"activity-label\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">运用你的经验</span>\n    <span class=\"dots\"></span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"photo-grid\">\n    <div class=\"photo-cell\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[照片：机场／车站国内安全检查通道，旅客排队接受安检]</div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">人们排队进行安全检查</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"photo-cell\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[照片：纺织车间内工人在纺纱机旁操作]</div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">纺纱工人按操作规程工作</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"photo-cell\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[照片：俯拍城市十字路口，行人、自行车与机动车分道通行]</div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">行人、自行车、机动车各行其道</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"photo-cell\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[照片：室内墙上悬挂“静 请勿大声喧哗”标识牌，旁有排队的人群]</div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">人们在公共场所保持安静</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"q-list\">\n    <div class=\"q-item\">\n      <span class=\"marker\">&#9679;&gt;</span>\n      <span>以上图片体现了哪些方面的社会秩序？<span class=\"answer\">社会管理秩序、生产秩序、交通秩序、公共场所秩序</span></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"q-item\">\n      <span class=\"marker\">&#9679;&gt;</span>\n      <span>如果没有秩序，我们的生活将会怎样？<span class=\"answer\">将会陷入无序化状态，混乱不堪。社会将不能正常</span></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"answer-line\">运转，人民将不能安居乐业</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <span class=\"pagenum\">22</span>第二单元　遵守社会规则\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"watermark\">统一版</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
